OL,3,CMan accused of killing boy, 12, in
OL,4,Calleged hit and run remanded in custody
OL,6,FA Latvian man accused of killing a 12-
OL,7,Fyear-old schoolboy in an alleged hit-
OL,8,Fand-run in Coventry has been remanded
OL,9,Fin custody after being extradited to
OL,10,Fthe UK.
OL,12,FDolars Aleksanders spoke only to
OL,13,Fconfirm his identity and date of birth
OL,14,Fduring a three-minute hearing at
OL,15,FBirmingham Magistrates' Court on
OL,16,FThursday (August 6th).
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/6
