PN,34702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786110488
OL,3,CMan accused of killing boy, 12, in
OL,4,Calleged hit and run remanded in custody
OL,6,FThe 23-year-old, who is charged with
OL,7,Fcausing the death of Keaton Slater by
OL,8,Fdangerous driving on Radford Road in
OL,9,FJune 2024, was remanded to appear at
OL,10,FBirmingham Crown Court on September
OL,11,F3rd.
OL,13,FDistrict Judge David Wain was told
OL,14,Fthat Aleksanders is alleged to have
OL,15,Fbeen driving a 15-plate black BMW when
OL,16,Fhe caused the death by driving
OL,17,Fdangerously on June 14th, 2024.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786110488
OL,3,CMan accused of killing boy, 12, in
OL,4,Calleged hit and run remanded in custody
OL,6,FRemanding Aleksanders in custody,
OL,7,FDistrict Judge Wain told the
OL,8,Fdefendant: "You have been returned to
OL,9,Fthe United Kingdom in relation to
OL,10,Fthese matters to face justice."
OL,12,FAleksanders, who was represented by
OL,13,Fdefence lawyer Michael Boylan, was
OL,14,Ftold the case can only be dealt with
OL,15,Fat the crown court.
OL,17,FKeaton's parents Louise and Clint
OL,18,FSlater were present in court for the
OL,19,Fshort hearing, sitting in the public
OL,20,Fgallery alongside police officers.
OL,26,@pD@LOUrD@_O]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/6
