OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786110488
OL,3,CMan accused of killing boy, 12, in
OL,4,Calleged hit and run remanded in custody
OL,6,FKeaton, a pupil at Coventry's Cardinal
OL,7,FNewman Catholic School, died at the
OL,8,Fscene on the city's Radford Road.
OL,10,FThe Crown Prosecution Service (CPS)
OL,11,Fsaid Aleksanders had been charged with
OL,12,Fcausing death by dangerous driving
OL,13,Fafter an extradition operation
OL,14,Finvolving British and Latvian
OL,15,Fauthorities.
OL,17,FWest Midlands Police said Aleksanders,
OL,18,Fwho was detained in Latvia last month,
OL,19,Fwas flown to Gatwick Airport on
OL,20,FWednesday and taken to a custody block.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786110488
OL,3,CMan accused of killing boy, 12, in
OL,4,Calleged hit and run remanded in custody
OL,6,FCPS spokesman Ben Samples said in a
OL,7,Fstatement: "The Crown Prosecution
OL,8,FService has decided to charge Dolars
OL,9,FAleksanders with one count of causing
OL,10,Fdeath by dangerous driving following a
OL,11,Fpolice investigation into a fatal road
OL,12,Ftraffic collision that led to the
OL,13,Fdeath of Keaton Slater.
OL,15,F"Our prosecutors have worked to
OL,16,Festablish that there is sufficient
OL,17,Fevidence to bring the case to court to
OL,18,Fpursue criminal proceedings.
OL,26,@oD@LOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786110488
OL,3,CMan accused of killing boy, 12, in
OL,4,Calleged hit and run remanded in custody
OL,6,F"CPS West Midlands has worked closely
OL,7,Fwith West Midlands Police, Home
OL,8,FOffice, the Latvian authorities,
OL,9,FEuropol, the Joint International Crime
OL,10,FCentre (JICC), CPS International and
OL,11,Four Extradition Unit to bring Mr
OL,12,FAleksanders back to face proceedings
OL,13,Fin a UK court for an alleged crime
OL,14,Fthat took place here."
OL,16,FPolice added that Keaton's parents
OL,17,Fwere being supported by specially
OL,18,Ftrained officers and had been updated
OL,19,Fon the developments.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@VO]
